This directory contains native Go adaptations of Runner wire DTOs and portions
of the original Server's polling authentication, node registry, synchronous
request lifecycle, and response handling. The implementation language, host
integration, supported operation subset, and validation tests are modified.
The protocol and runner READMEs define the present migration scope.

